# Fact-Forcing Gate Info:
# 1. Importers/Callers: Git CLI (git add, git status, git commit)
# 2. Existing files: No .gitignore exists in repo root
# 3. Data schemas: Standard gitignore syntax for excluding node_modules, .env secrets, and temp files
# 4. User verbatim: "Filename too long error: unable to index file 'node_modules/...'"

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

